d\udd26 Choose your own approach</strong>: Go in with a bang or be stealthy. Plan everything carefully in advance or improvise. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc9 <strong>Risks and reward</strong>: Face the consequences of your actions, be it a stint in prison or a hospital stay. Manage your time wisely, as the clock never ceases to tick! Will you retire to a life of luxury, or will you spend the rest of your days behind bars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730910/extras/004af22c3d8543850598066d77f92247.avif?t=1753783118\" data-has-big width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730910/extras/df63ad23bba291496a11e258dfd532e4.poster.avif?t=1753783118\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730910/extras/df63ad23bba291496a11e258dfd532e4.webm?t=1753783118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730910/extras/df63ad23bba291496a11e258dfd532e4.mp4?t=1753783118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Play solo or with friends</strong>: Experience the main story-driven campaign and sandbox modes by yourself. Or team up with up to 3 other accomplices in real-time co-op multiplayer. Coordinate with your crew to plan the ultimate heist, or improvise when everything (almost inevitably) goes wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Create and share levels</strong>: Use the built-in level editor to design your own burglary scenarios. Craft intricate maps fil